---
// Logo options, round 7, for Mandeep: marks in the spirit of the image most
// often shown for PolinRider (a skeleton riding a horse, in an officer's
// cap), drawn from the defender's side so ours never reads as the
// malware's own mascot. Original geometry only; the source image was used
// for inspiration and nothing in it is traced or copied. No national
// insignia; the caps are generic peaked caps, each shown with and without.
// Not linked, noindex, out of the sitemap and search. Delete once chosen.
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

// Round 8: crafted variations of the two directions Mandeep kept.
